    <!-- Empty on purpose. A free Apple ID ("personal team") can't sign
         Sign in with Apple or push, so building Plannit.entitlements on one
         fails outright. Nothing in the app calls Sign in with Apple yet — live
         mode signs in with dev email — so dropping it costs nothing today.
         See DEVICE-TESTING.md; switch back to Plannit.entitlements once
         there's a paid membership. -->
</dict>
</plist>
